<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="h-full">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8"/>
  <meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" name="viewport"/>
  <title>Security Desk Handover - Project HANAP CSPC</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" rel="preconnect"/>
  <link crossorigin="" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" rel="preconnect"/>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:wght,FILL@100..700,0..1&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style>
    @layer base {
      html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      body { overscroll-behavior: none; }
    }
  </style>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com?plugins=forms,container-queries"></script>
  <script id="tailwind-config">
    tailwind.config = {
      darkMode: "class",
      theme: {
        extend: {
          colors: {
            "background": "#F4F7FB",
            "primary": "#09436B",
            "primary-container": "#2B5B84",
            "on-surface": "#0F172A",
            "text-muted": "#64748B",
            "border-subtle": "#E2E8F0"
          },
          fontFamily: {
            sans: ["Plus Jakarta Sans", "sans-serif"]
          }
        }
      }
    };
  </script>
</head>
<body class="min-h-full bg-[#F4F7FB] font-sans text-slate-800 antialiased flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-x-hidden">
  
  <!-- Ambient Aurora Canvas Background -->
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden -z-10">
    <div class="absolute -top-[15%] -left-[10%] w-[540px] h-[540px] rounded-full bg-[#2B5B84]/10 blur-[130px]"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-[30%] -right-[10%] w-[580px] h-[580px] rounded-full bg-[#3B82F6]/10 blur-[140px]"></div>
  </div>

  <%- include('partials/navbar', { active: 'catalog' }) %>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <main class="w-full max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-center">
    <div class="rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 bg-white/85 backdrop-blur-2xl border border-white/90 shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(15,23,42,0.08)] space-y-6">
      
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#09436B] to-[#2B5B84] text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-md shadow-primary/20">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-2xl">shield</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Security Desk Routing</h1>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Official protocol for Parents, Guardians, and Campus Guests</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <% if (caseId) { %>
        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-blue-50/90 border border-blue-200 text-xs font-semibold text-[#09436B] flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">info</span>
          <span>Inquiring about Case Reference: <strong>#<%= caseId %></strong></span>
        </div>
      <% } %>

      <div class="space-y-3.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          For security and privacy, recovered items flagged with security custody or claimed by non-institutional guests are managed via the <strong>CSPC Security Office &amp; Lost and Found Service Desk</strong>.
        </p>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200/80 space-y-2">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider">Claim Verification Procedure</h3>
          <ol class="list-decimal pl-4 space-y-1 text-slate-600 text-xs">
            <li>Visit the <strong>CSPC Main Gate Security Office</strong> during campus hours (8:00 AM - 5:00 PM, Mon-Fri).</li>
            <li>Present a valid government ID (Driver's License, PhilID, Passport, Voter's ID).</li>
            <li>Provide the Case Reference number <%= caseId ? `(#${caseId})` : '' %> and describe the item's identifying features.</li>
            <li>Sign the official campus property release ledger.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <div class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 text-emerald-800 text-xs flex items-center gap-2.5">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-emerald-600 text-lg">call</span>
          <div>
            <span class="font-bold block">Security Office Contact</span>
            <span>Tel: (054) 288-5123 local 104 • Email: security@cspc.edu.ph</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between">
        <a href="/catalog" class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800">
          &larr; Back to Catalog
        </a>
        <% if (user) { %>
          <a href="/dashboard" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[#09436B] text-white text-xs font-bold shadow-xs hover:bg-[#204667] transition">
            Return to Dashboard
          </a>
        <% } else { %>
          <a href="/login?category=guest" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[#09436B] text-white text-xs font-bold shadow-xs hover:bg-[#204667] transition">
            Sign In as Guest
          </a>
        <% } %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>

